  "content": "<h1>网站: <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.shivamzter.com%252fjava%252froundista\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.shivamzter.com/java/roundista</a></h1>\n<h2>什么是 Roundista？</h2>\n<p>Roundista 是一款手绘的、完全符合 LabPBR 标准的纹理包，它将 Minecraft 的像素艺术风格转变为圆润风格。</p>\n<blockquote>\n  <p><strong>256x 和 512x</strong> 版本附带<strong>附加组件</strong>以及<strong>CTM</strong>等功能，可在<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.shivamzter.com%252fstore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">商店</a>获取。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>如何安装？</h2>\n<p>您可以按照此安装指南操作：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.shivamzter.com%252finstallation%252fresourcepack%252fjava\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.shivamzter.com/installation/resourcepack/java</a>。</p>\n<h2>有基岩版吗？</h2>\n<p>是的，该资源包也适用于 Minecraft 基岩版，并支持鲜艳视觉效果和 RTX 图形模式。更多信息请参见<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.shivamzter.com%252fbedrock%252froundista\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。</p>\n<h2>有问题或需要帮助？</h2>\n<p>请通过<a href=\"https://discord.gg/5rxYKg4ceD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 服务器</a>联系我们，或发送邮件至 <strong>hello@shivamzter.com</strong>。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/I__HmJCII28\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/PtJqZDu-D5Q\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>",
